# GS3
#
DEF GS3 J 0 40 Y N 1 F N
F0 "J" 50 200 50 H V C CNN
F1 "GS3" 50 -199 50 H V C CNN
F2 "Connectors:GS3" 88 -74 50 V I C CNN
