$FPLIST
 GS*
$ENDFPLIST
DRAW
P 4 0 1 0 -50 -140 -50 -60 50 -60 50 -140 F
P 4 0 1 0 -50 40 50 40 50 -40 -50 -40 F
P 4 0 1 0 -50 140 -50 60 50 60 50 140 F
X G1 1 -150 100 100 R 50 50 1 1 P
X G2 2 150 0 100 L 50 50 1 1 P
X G3 3 -150 -100 100 R 50 50 1 1 P
